# DiscoverUzb — Environment variables shabloni
#
# Bu fayl Git'ga kommit qilinadi (qiymatsiz placeholder'lar bilan).
# Haqiqiy `.env` fayl `.gitignore` da — uni nusxalab oling va to'ldiring:
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#   # keyin har qiymatni o'zgartiring
#
# Build vaqtida `--dart-define-from-file=.env` orqali ishlatiladi
# (Flutter 3.7+).
#
# Yoki har qiymatni alohida `--dart-define=KEY=VALUE` qilib bering.
#
# Batafsil: docs/security-rules.md

# ===== Supabase =====
SUPABASE_URL=https://<your-project>.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<your-anon-key>

# ===== DevSMS (OTP yuborish) =====
DEVSMS_BASE_URL=https://devsms.uz/api/send_sms.php
DEVSMS_TOKEN=<your-bearer-token>

# ===== OpenWeatherMap =====
OPENWEATHER_API_KEY=<your-api-key>

# ===== Test rejim (faqat debug build'da ishlaydi) =====
# Agar kerak bo'lsa, test telefon raqami va doimiy OTP berishingiz mumkin.
# Production'da bo'sh qoldiring — test rejim o'chiq bo'ladi.
# TEST_PHONE=+998901234567
# TEST_OTP=000000
